# Environment Configuration
NODE_ENV=production

# Server Configuration
PORT=5000
CORS_ORIGIN=https://dexelearning.vercel.app
FRONTEND_URL=https://dexelearning.vercel.app

# Database Configuration
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/Dex_Elearning

# JWT Configuration
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-secret
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-refresh-secret
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRE=30d

# AI / External Services (Google Gemini)
# Get a free API key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash

# Optional Anthropic provider for admin PDF lesson summaries, study notes, and quizzes.
# Create a key in the Anthropic Console. Keep this key only in the backend .env.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# File Upload Configuration
MAX_FILE_SIZE=5000000
FILE_UPLOAD_PATH=./uploads

# Security
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12

# Email / Password Reset (Brevo SMTP)
# Get SMTP credentials at https://app.brevo.com > SMTP & API > SMTP
# SMTP_USER = your Brevo account email, SMTP_PASS = your SMTP key (not the account password)
SMTP_HOST=smtp-relay.brevo.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=
EMAIL_FROM="DexElearning <noreply@yourdomain.com>"
# Public URL of the frontend (used in reset links)
APP_URL=https://dexelearning.vercel.app

# First admin bootstrap (used only by `npm run seed:admin`)
ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
ADMIN_FULLNAME=Platform Admin
SMTP_HOST=smtp-relay.brevo.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=inezadervaux@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-key
EMAIL_FROM=DexElearning <noreply@yourdomain.com>
APP_URL=https://dexelearning.vercel.app
1. Create a free account at brevo.com (https://www.brevo.com) → go to SMTP & API → SMTP
2. Generate an SMTP key (this is the password — not your Brevo login password)
3. Add to backend .env (and the same vars in Render dashboard):